          "date": "2026-10-07T17:24:16+00:00"
        },
        "message": "Add go-live tooling: configure, buyback automation, deploy files, guide\n\n- chain configure: one command sets launches/config.json and the\n  dashboard CONFIG (validated addresses and URLs; HTTPS API required)\n- requireGoogle toggle: wallet-only identity for launches among friends\n- launcher: settles everyone right after the buy (--no-settle to skip),\n  --at for a scheduled launch, refuses before launchAt; refunds open 24h\n  after launchAt by default\n- onchain/client/buyback.js: swaps fee SOL for $BUNDLEPAD via Jupiter,\n  burns it, records both on the chain; cron-safe, --dry-run\n- dashboard: reads the chain live from the API when configured\n- deploy/: systemd unit, Caddyfile (auto HTTPS), publish-to-GitHub cron\n- docs/GO-LIVE.md: setup, running a launch with friends, costs,\n  troubleshooting\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019dLaQpC8ustRzQLisewKPK"
      },
